  (text "09/09/2026\n----------\ngpio 16 is reserved to pir input of the plugin\ngpio 0 is reserved for usb programming\n\n01 : add on/off switch (alternative)\n\n02 : change neopixels size to bigger \n03 : neopixels: gpio12 with jumper\n\n04 : use another gpio instead of gpio4 which is the camera light\n05 : usb c: add 5.1 k resistors\n06 : add button for gpio0 for boot mode\n07 : add holes for roulettes\n08 : add oled on gpio1,3 shared with console, add pullups\n09 : PWMA/PWMB → 3.3 V. free gpio12\n10 : TB6612 vcc, stby, pwmx -> 3.3v\n11 : J4: pin 10: v3.3v\n12 : antenna hole\n13 : remoe 2n7002 drivers\n14 : add servos\n\n\n\n"
    (at 182.88 261.62 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 5a50d664-d369-446b-8005-ce8a940abd7f)
  )
